OL,3,ANicolas Cage's driveway collapses as
OL,4,Asinkhole opens up at his Malibu home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe actor bought the home in 2024,
OL,7,Faccording to a report in the New York
OL,8,FTimes shortly after the sale.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
