SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788954495
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASouth Park creators rename show 'South
OL,4,AAmerica' in apparent dig at Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump signed an executive order in
OL,7,FAugust to rename Lake Ontario as Lake
OL,8,FAmerica, and last year declared that
OL,9,Fthe Gulf of Mexico be known as the Gulf
OL,10,Fof America.
OL,12,FThe announcement from South Park, now
OL,13,Fin its 29th season, comes after the
OL,14,Fshow won an Emmy for Outstanding
OL,15,FAnimated Program on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
