OL,3,AAlan Carr holds back tears on special
OL,4,Anight at National Television Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou can see a full list of winners at
OL,7,Fthe bottom of this article
OL,9,FAlan Carr had an emotional night at the
OL,10,F31st National Television Awards on
OL,11,FTuesday as he received the Special
OL,12,FRecognition prize following a whirlwind
OL,13,Fyear for the comedian.
OL,15,FThe London audience had just been
OL,16,Ftreated to a Traitors-themed musical
OL,17,Fperformance in his honour, which
OL,18,Fincluded fellow cast member Paloma
OL,19,FFaith emerging from a coffin, when he
OL,20,Fwas given the surprise award.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
